    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-7A2E9F7AAB4237E6-Q4">
      <question_stem>정현파 정보신호를 AM 변조한 신호의 포락선의 최댓값과 최솟값이 각각 20 [V]와 4 [V]일 때, 변조지수는? (단, 변조지수는 0과 1 사이이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>정현파</keyword>
        <keyword>정보신호</keyword>
        <keyword>변조한</keyword>
        <keyword>신호</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\frac{2}{3}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답가안</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 통신이론 · AM 변조지수
정답은 ②이다. 변조지수는 m = (Amax − Amin)/(Amax + Amin) = (20 − 4)/(20 + 4) = 16/24 = 2/3이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{1}{2}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\frac{2}{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>2/3이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{3}{4}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{4}{5}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
